# Fortio Agent – Deployment & Infrastructure

## Docker

- **Dockerfile**: [apps/agent/Dockerfile](mdc:apps/agent/Dockerfile)
- Two-stage build: `base` (deps + code) → `runtime` (non-root `appuser`)
- Runs as non-root user (`appuser`, UID 1000)
- Both services start in the same container via shell `&` in CMD

## Ports

| Port | Service |
|---|---|
| `8000` | Chainlit UI (`chainlit run agent/ui/chainlit_app.py`) |
| `8001` | FastAPI REST API (`uvicorn agent.api.main:app`) |

## Local Dev with Docker Compose

```bash
cd apps/agent/docker
docker compose up          # start all services
docker compose down        # stop and remove containers
docker compose down -v     # also remove volumes (wipes DB)
```

Compose file: [apps/agent/docker/docker-compose.yml](mdc:apps/agent/docker/docker-compose.yml)
DB init script: [apps/agent/docker/init-db.sql](mdc:apps/agent/docker/init-db.sql)

## Required Environment Variables

Defined in `agent/config.py` via pydantic-settings. Create `apps/agent/.env`:

```bash
# LLM
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...
OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...           # fallback only

# Ghostfolio
GHOSTFOLIO_BASE_URL=https://ghostfol.io
GHOSTFOLIO_ACCESS_TOKEN=...
GHOSTFOLIO_PUBLIC_ACCESS_ID=...

# Observability (LangSmith)
LANGCHAIN_TRACING_V2=true
LANGCHAIN_API_KEY=ls__...
LANGCHAIN_PROJECT=fortio-agent

# Infrastructure
DATABASE_URL=postgresql://user:pass@localhost:5432/fortio
REDIS_URL=redis://localhost:6379/0

# App tuning
ENVIRONMENT=production
LOG_LEVEL=INFO
PORTFOLIO_CONCENTRATION_THRESHOLD=0.20
MARKET_DATA_FRESHNESS_MINUTES=15
MAX_TOOL_RETRIES=2
```

## Infrastructure Dependencies

| Service | Purpose | Default |
|---|---|---|
| **PostgreSQL** | Conversation checkpointing, user data | `DATABASE_URL` |
| **Redis** | Caching, session state | `redis://localhost:6379/0` |

## Running Locally (without Docker)

```bash
cd apps/agent
python -m venv .venv && source .venv/bin/activate
pip install -r requirements.txt

# Start Chainlit UI (port 8000)
chainlit run agent/ui/chainlit_app.py

# Start FastAPI (port 8001) — in a separate terminal
uvicorn agent.api.main:app --host 0.0.0.0 --port 8001 --reload
```

## Stopping Services

```bash
# Kill Chainlit (port 8000)
kill $(lsof -ti :8000)

# Kill FastAPI (port 8001)
kill $(lsof -ti :8001)

# Kill both at once
kill $(lsof -ti :8000) $(lsof -ti :8001)
```

## Build & Push (CI/CD)

```bash
# Build from apps/agent/ directory
docker build -t fortio-agent:latest .

# Tag and push
docker tag fortio-agent:latest <registry>/fortio-agent:latest
docker push <registry>/fortio-agent:latest
```
